    "note_type": "meeting",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-1",
        "text": "Okay, backend hiring. Priya, you have the hiring numbers.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802003109,
        "startMs": 3109,
        "endMs": 7570,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-2",
        "text": "Yes. Backend hiring is down to the final round, with two finalists.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802008815,
        "startMs": 8815,
        "endMs": 14393,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-3",
        "text": "Thirty-one backend applicants made it into the hiring funnel, and six got phone screens.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802015195,
        "startMs": 15195,
        "endMs": 22009,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-4",
        "text": "Both finalists are strong on the API side. The difference is database work.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802022943,
        "startMs": 22943,
        "endMs": 29913,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-5",
        "text": "How many of them have run a big schema change?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802031239,
        "startMs": 31239,
        "endMs": 36364,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-6",
        "text": "Only one of the two finalists.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802037122,
        "startMs": 37122,
        "endMs": 40564,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-7",
        "text": "The first one moved a payments company onto a new ledger schema. Two hundred million rows, zero downtime.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802041183,
        "startMs": 41183,
        "endMs": 51076,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-8",
        "text": "She wants a decision by Friday. She has another offer on the table.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802051794,
        "startMs": 51794,
        "endMs": 57815,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-9",
        "text": "Then we move fast on her. That's the hiring decision for this week.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802059215,
        "startMs": 59215,
        "endMs": 65789,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-10",
        "text": "That's exactly the experience we're short on right now.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802066676,
        "startMs": 66676,
        "endMs": 71268,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-11",
        "text": "On the interview loop, the take-home is losing people.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802072324,
        "startMs": 72324,
        "endMs": 76520,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-12",
        "text": "Three of the six candidates dropped at the take-home stage of the interview loop.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802077426,
        "startMs": 77426,
        "endMs": 83867,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-13",
        "text": "The take-home is four hours, honestly. Senior people won't do four hours of unpaid work.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802085005,
        "startMs": 85005,
        "endMs": 93239,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-14",
        "text": "Then replace the take-home with a paired session in the interview loop.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802094400,
        "startMs": 94400,
        "endMs": 100320,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-15",
        "text": "A ninety-minute paired session on a real migration bug. Better signal, shorter interview loop.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802101666,
        "startMs": 101666,
        "endMs": 109486,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-16",
        "text": "Can we change the interview loop before the final round?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802110753,
        "startMs": 110753,
        "endMs": 115476,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-17",
        "text": "Yes, starting this week.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802116370,
        "startMs": 116370,
        "endMs": 118478,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-18",
        "text": "Good. I'll tell both final candidates about the new interview loop today.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802119027,
        "startMs": 119027,
        "endMs": 124506,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-19",
        "text": "Whoever joins owns the data migration from week one.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802125374,
        "startMs": 125374,
        "endMs": 130461,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-20",
        "text": "The data migration needs an owner before the launch, so that works for me.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802131736,
        "startMs": 131736,
        "endMs": 138640,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-21",
        "text": "Ines carries the data migration alone at the moment, and that's the real risk.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802140037,
        "startMs": 140037,
        "endMs": 147660,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-22",
        "text": "Did the second finalist ever own a data migration?",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802148859,
        "startMs": 148859,
        "endMs": 153415,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-23",
        "text": "No idea, honestly.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802155002,
        "startMs": 155002,
        "endMs": 156753,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-24",
        "text": "I'll ask him on Thursday.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802157797,
        "startMs": 157797,
        "endMs": 160533,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-25",
        "text": "The data migration also needs a second reviewer before the launch, whoever we hire.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802162027,
        "startMs": 162027,
        "endMs": 168752,
        "speaker": "speaker_1",
        "speakerName": "Maya",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-26",
        "text": "Ruth can review the data migration rollback with Ines.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802169968,
        "startMs": 169968,
        "endMs": 174679,
        "speaker": "speaker_3",
        "speakerName": "Theo",
        "speakerIsPlaceholder": false,
        "speakerStatus": "locked",
        "speakerLocked": false
      },
      {
        "id": "seg-muol7rtk-27",
        "text": "And I'll send both finalists the new schedule tonight.",
        "source": "mic",
        "timestamp": 1790802176003,
        "startMs": 176003,
        "endMs": 180105,
        "speaker": "speaker_2",
        "speakerName": "Priya",
